      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地说，如果分数的分子和分母同乘或同除以相同的",
        "自然数，就可以得到与原分数相等的分数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这种性质叫做分数的基本性质. 例如：",
        "$\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{4}{10}$；$\\frac{9}{15}=\\frac{3}{5}$；$\\frac{16}{8}=\\frac{2}{1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个相等的分数是同一个数的不同写法."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可以写成分数形式的数叫做有理数. 有理数的集合用$Q$",
        "表示. 任何整数都是有理数，例如：",
        "$4=\\frac{4}{1},\\quad-6=\\frac{-6}{1},\\quad0=\\frac{0}{1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "整数集合$Z$是有理数集合$Q$的子集，即，$Z\\subset Q$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "694",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "694. 将$\\frac{1}{5},\\frac{3}{7},\\frac{25}{8},\\frac{39}{40}$各分数的分子和分母同乘以5，并写出",
        "等式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "695",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "695. 把$\\frac{6}{3},\\ \\frac{9}{6},\\ \\frac{15}{9},\\ \\frac{33}{21}$各分数的分子和分母同除以3，并写",
        "出等式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "696",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "696. 说明下列等式为什么能成立：",
        "1) $\\frac{4}{5}=\\frac{8}{10}$；　　2) $\\frac{44}{100}=\\frac{11}{25}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "697",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "697. 求出正有理数集合和负有理数集合的交集与并集."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "698",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "698. 求出整数集合和有理数集合的交集与并集."
      ]
    },
